{
  "pages": [
    {
      "pageId": "IntroStory",
      "aboutPage": "New Page",
      "pageFiles": [
        {
          "key": "Panel_1",
          "originalValue": "\u064A\u0632\u0646 \u0627\u062D\u0643 \u0644\u0646\u0627 \u0642\u0635\u0629",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "As the sun sets, the family gathers around the fire"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_2",
          "originalValue": "\u2026\u2026..",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "Yazan sits among them, holding his cloth doll."
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_3",
          "originalValue": "\u0647\u0644 \u062A\u0631\u064A\u062F \u0623\u0646 \u062A\u062A\u062C\u0648\u0644 \u0642\u0644\u064A\u0644\u0627 \u0642\u0628\u0644 \u0623\u0646 \u062A\u0638\u0644\u0645\u061F",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "father turns to him"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_4",
          "originalValue": "\u062D\u0633\u0646\u0627",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": " FATHER:  \u201CTell us a story\u201D"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_5",
          "originalValue": "\u064A\u0632\u0646... \u0644\u0627 \u062A\u0628\u062A\u0639\u062F \u0643\u062B\u064A\u0631\u064B\u0627. \u0644\u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0643\u0627\u0646 \u062D\u0643\u0627\u064A\u0627\u062A \u0645\u062E\u064A\u0641\u0629",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "Yazan lowers his eyes. He has no story to tell"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_6",
          "originalValue": "\u062F\u0645\u064A\u062A\u064A \u0645\u0639\u064A... \u0644\u0646 \u0623\u0636\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0637\u0631\u064A\u0642.",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "He picks up his backpack and doll and wanders off to explore the valley"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_7",
          "originalValue": "\u0638\u0646 \u064A\u0632\u0646 \u0623\u0646\u0647 \u064A\u0639\u0631\u0641 \u0637\u0631\u064A\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0648\u062F\u0629. \u0644\u0643\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0627\u062F\u064A \u0643\u0627\u0646 \u064A\u0628\u062F\u0651\u0644 \u0645\u0644\u0627\u0645\u062D\u0647 \u0645\u0639 \u0643\u0644 \u062E\u0637\u0648\u0629. \u0643\u0644 \u0635\u062E\u0631\u0629 \u062A\u0634\u0628\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062E\u0631\u0649\u060C \u0648\u0643\u0644 \u0645\u0645\u0631 \u064A\u0642\u0648\u062F \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u062B\u0644\u0647\u060C \u062D\u062A\u0649 \u062A\u0644\u0627\u0634\u062A \u0648\u062C\u0647\u062A\u0647 \u0645\u0646 \u0630\u0627\u0643\u0631\u062A\u0647. \u0648\u062D\u064A\u0646 \u0623\u062F\u0631\u0643 \u0623\u0646\u0647 \u062A\u0627\u0626\u0647\u060C \u0644\u0627\u062D \u0644\u0647 \u0641\u064A \u0627\u0644\u0638\u0644\u0627\u0645 \u0636\u0648\u0621 \u062E\u0627\u0641\u062A... \r\n",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "MOTHER: \u201CYazan\u2026 don\u2019t go too far. There are frightening stories about this place\u201D"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_8",
          "originalValue": "\u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0647\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u062E\u0641\u0627\u0621... \u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064C \u064A\u062C\u0627\u0648\u0631 \u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0643\u0645. \u0623\u0642\u062F\u0645 \u0645\u0646 \u0643\u0644 \u0645\u0627 \u0639\u0631\u0641\u062A\u0647\u060C \u0648\u0645\u062D\u062C\u0648\u0628 \u0639\u0646 \u0623\u0639\u064A\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0634\u0631. \u0643\u0627\u0646 \u064A\u0648\u0645\u064B\u0627 \u0646\u0627\u0628\u0636\u064B\u0627 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u062D\u064A\u0627\u0629... \u0623\u0645\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646 \u0641\u0642\u062F \u0627\u0639\u062A\u0631\u0627\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0636. \u0646\u0633\u064A \u0647\u064A\u0626\u062A\u0647\u060C \u0641\u0623\u0635\u0628\u062D \u064A\u0639\u064A\u062F \u0646\u0641\u0633\u0647 \u0645\u0631\u0627\u0631\u064B\u0627\u060C \u0628\u0627\u062D\u062B\u064B\u0627 \u0639\u0645\u0651\u0627 \u0627\u0646\u062A\u064F\u0632\u0639 \u0645\u0646\u0647.",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "YAZAN: \u201CI have my doll with me\u2026 I won\u2019t get lost\u201D"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_9",
          "originalValue": "\u0641\u064A \u0643\u0644 \u062F\u0648\u0631\u0629\u060C \u064A\u0648\u062C\u062F \u0634\u064A\u0621 \u0644\u0627 \u064A\u0646\u062A\u0645\u064A \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0643\u0627\u0646. \u0639\u0644\u064A\u0643 \u0623\u0646 \u062A\u0639\u062B\u0631 \u0639\u0644\u064A\u0647. \u0633\u0631\u0652 \u064A\u0633\u0627\u0631\u064B\u0627 \u0623\u0648 \u064A\u0645\u064A\u0646\u064B\u0627\u060C \u0644\u0627 \u0641\u0631\u0642. \u0625\u0646 \u0631\u0623\u064A\u062A \u0634\u064A\u0626\u064B\u0627 \u0644\u064A\u0633 \u0641\u064A \u0645\u0648\u0636\u0639\u0647\u060C \u0641\u0627\u0631\u062C\u0639 \u0639\u062F \u0645\u0646 \u062D\u064A\u062B \u0623\u062A\u064A\u062A. \u0648\u0625\u0646 \u0644\u0645 \u062A\u0631\u064E \u0634\u064A\u0626\u064B\u0627\u060C \u0641\u0648\u0627\u0635\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u064A\u0631 \u0628\u0646\u0641\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u062A\u062C\u0627\u0647.",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "Yazan continues on his way"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_10",
          "originalValue": "\u062A\u062C\u0627\u0648\u0632",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "Yazan thinks he knows the way back. But the valley changes with every step"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_11",
          "originalValue": "New Field",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "Every rock resembles another. Every path leads to one just like it, until he can no longer remember which way he came"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_12",
          "originalValue": "New Field",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "Suddenly, nails begin piercing the doll, one after another, until there are ten"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_13",
          "originalValue": "New Field",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "He looks down at his doll, holding it carefully with tears in his eyes. Then, a light appears before him"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_14",
          "originalValue": "New Field",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": "Yazan follows the light between rocks and forgotten paths until he reaches an ancient wall. \r\nThere, he finds an ancient, motionless figure standing in the shadows, holding a lantern\u2026unlike anything he has ever seen"
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_15",
          "originalValue": " The old jinn studies the boy for a long moment. Then he speaks.\r\n\r\nGATEKEEPER: \u201CYou are not lost, child\u2026 you are somewhere else entirely\u201D",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": ""
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_16",
          "originalValue": "GATEKEEPER: \u201CThis is Alkhafa\u2026 a world beside your own, hidden from human eyes. It was once full of life\u2026 \r\n           \r\nNow it\u2019s sick. It has forgotten its own shape, repeating itself again and again, searching for what was taken from it\u201D",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": ""
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        },
        {
          "key": "Panel_17",
          "originalValue": "The Gatekeeper lowers his gaze to the doll in Yazan\u2019s hand and points to it\r\n GATEKEEPER: - \u201CStart in either direction, left or right. In each loop, you may find something that does not belong.\r\n If you notice a change, turn back the way you came. If you find nothing, keep going in the same direction.\u201D                                    \r\n\u201CEach correct choice frees a nail. One mistake brings them all back.\u201D\r\n\u201CThe doll knows\u2026 trust what it shows you. Go now\u2026 I will be here\u201D",
          "variants": [
            {
              "language": "en",
              "_value": ""
            }
          ],
          "aliases": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "keysLocked": false,
  "originalValuesLocked": false,
  "lockedLanguages": "",
  "pageIdsLocked": false,
  "aboutPagesLocked": false,
  "aliasesLocked": false,
  "encryptedPassword": ""
}